# Normalise line endings in the repository, check out native in the working
# tree. Matters now that Windows and the web are targets.
* text=auto

# Scripts must stay LF even when checked out on Windows: CRLF breaks the
# shebang line and the shell reports a cryptic "bad interpreter".
*.sh text eol=lf

# Never munge binaries.
*.glb binary
*.gltf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.wasm binary

# Generated; do not review as source in diffs.
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md linguist-generated=true
